                                                Label { height: 32px * Theme.ui-scale; text: root.chinese ? "添加新音效用增量扫描；整理或移动文件后，用全量扫描检查所选文件夹。均包含子文件夹。" : "Use incremental scans to add sounds; use full scans to recheck a folder after reorganizing files. Both include subfolders."; wrap: word-wrap; }
